WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
At rest, you breathe
about 12 times a minute.

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.190
On a hard run, that can climb to 30.

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.940
But the real work happens in the alveoli,

4
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.160
deep inside the chest,
where no one can see.

5
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:17.030
So how can you tell, from the outside,
how well a person's lungs are working?

6
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.230
In this mission, you'll find
out what is worth measuring,

7
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.210
and what the numbers can tell you.

8
00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.670
Then you'll see what those numbers can
reveal about the lungs hidden inside the

9
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.770
chest.

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.660
Your mission: find out how you
can tell, from the outside,

11
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.800
how well a person's lungs are working.
